{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"ScanbotSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration(im)init","role":"symbol","title":"init","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration\/init","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:*Qo","text":"id","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration\/init"]}],"references":{"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration":{"title":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The view finder configuration object for a ‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and its subclasses."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Sometimes it is necessary to limit a live video frame detection or recognition to a certain rectangular area with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a specific aspect ratio: the region or rectangle of interest. This is where a view finder comes in.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It crops the video frame to that region of interest before passing it to any detector or recognizer. Usually","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the performance of detectors\/recognizers gain a benefit from it because less pixels must be processed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Additionally, to guide the user, the view finder visualizes the region of interest by drawing a rectangle around","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"on the user interface.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration/init":{"url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration\/init","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration\/init","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"init","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk","kind":"symbol","title":"ScanbotSDK","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Version: 6.1.2"}]}},"variantOverrides":[{"patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1net.doo.ScanbotSDK~1documentation~1ScanbotSDK~1SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration\/title","value":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration"},{"op":"replace","value":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration"}],"path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1net.doo.Scanbo